>>
Rule 1 (dimension must be within valid range for input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= -1 × ndim(v_1) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor should have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor should not have zero dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
